            </div>
            <h1 class="shg-subject-auth-title" data-shg-auth-title>正在进入语文系统</h1>
            <p class="shg-subject-auth-desc" data-shg-auth-desc>正在核验当前账号的统一登录状态，并准备进入该学科系统，请稍候。</p>
